    { "type": "textarea", "id": "faq_a1", "label": "A1", "default": "This page lists every real Australian kids' competition we have verified for 2026 - covering art, writing, photography, film, STEM, maths, performance, music, and social good. Pick a category, filter by age, state, cost or format, and click through to the official entry page. New comps are added monthly." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "faq_q2", "label": "Q2", "default": "Are kids competitions in Australia free to enter?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "faq_a2", "label": "A2", "default": "Most are free. Some charge a small entry fee (often $5-$20), and a few are paid-optional, where there is a free option alongside a paid stream with bigger prizes. Use the cost filter on this page to show only free competitions, only paid, or any combination." },
